      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The study of the predictors impacting the development of bronchial asthma in children was implemented. For each risk factor the chances ratio and its 95% confidence interval were calculated. The sample consisted of 280 children with bronchial asthma aged from 7 to 14 years and 210 healthy children of the same age. The risk factors having priority significance for the development of bronchial asthma in children are identified. The research data can be applied to calculate of the individual risks in population to forecast the development of bronchial asthma and its timely prevention."},
